WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.870
The Dim Sum Master “Steel Bar Xie”

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:39.100
wanted to challenge me in shumai.

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.300
His cooking speed of shumai is beyond imagination.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.770
Every one of us was amazed.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:46.010
I'm done, Chef Ruoh.

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:47.990
I've made shumai for fifty people.

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:50.440
He has already made shumai for fifty people?

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:52.300
Only half of the time has passed.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.530
This is the most perfect shumai.

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:03.700
Shine! Big Bang Shumai

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.110
This... This is...

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:11.220
He divided the shumai wrapper into four small parts.

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:13.700
Four different fillings were stuffed
in the four parts respectively.

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:16.250
Four kinds of fillings?

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:23.090
Really?

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:24.350
Hey. Look.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.990
The crooked shape.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.290
If he wants to divide it into four parts,

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.950
he should divide it evenly.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:32.060
I thought he just behaves so rudely.

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:34.430
I didn't expect that
his handwork is also very clumsy.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.750
Third-class chefs like you won't get it.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:41.760
What?

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:43.200
I've already told you

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:46.000
this is the best shumai.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.230
It's the Golden Ratio Shumai

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:53.790
made by me!

00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:04.670
Golden ratio?

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:06.200
What do you mean?

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:10.480
You'll know after you taste it.

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:16.230
OK. I'm gonna have a taste.

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:33.460
I'm curious. What do you think?

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.470
Does it taste good?

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.960
It's so wonderful.

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:47.330
Chef Ruoh!

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:49.810
Your shumai is so wonderful.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.970
Old man, what are you talking about?

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.020
Are you drunk?

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:55.910
You're talking nonsense here.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:57.940
No. You're talking nonsense!

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:00.870
Chef Ruoh has the best tongue in China.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:03.910
But it's unnecessary to praise an opponent like that.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:04.750
Be quiet.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:05.870
Chef Ruoh will explain.

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:11.370
After shrimps have been ground into a paste,

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:13.100
their elasticity remains.

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:18.100
The delicious vegetables are very fresh and crisp.

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.880
And the yolks are soft and sweet.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.930
Besides, the Jinhua ham

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.640
with a smooth texture that is oily but not greasy.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.820
The two of you selected the same ingredients.

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:37.080
The most successful point of this shumai

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:40.130
is the ratio of weights of the four ingredients.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.860
They didn't cover up each other's taste.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.530
Instead, they integrated with each other.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.920
It all depends on the control over
the ratio of weights.

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:51.150
Am I right, Chef Xie?

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:53.650
Chef Ruoh, you're so great.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:57.210
The leading role of shumai is always pork.

00:04:57.590 --> 00:04:58.610
But if there is no supporting role,

00:04:58.660 --> 00:04:59.840
there will be no foil for the leading role.

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:03.310
The ratio of them decides shumai's taste.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.970
The ratio of ingredients of my shumai is like,

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:07.790
the pork is 8,

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:08.830
the shrimp is 5.

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:11.150
the vegetable is 5 and the egg is 5.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:12.740
No matter what ingredient I match to the pork,

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.820
the ratio is always 8:5.
It's a balanced ratio of the taste.

00:05:15.270 --> 00:05:18.340
It's the golden ratio of taste.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.430
With the best ratio,

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:22.100
the food will have the best taste.

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:26.630
So he made shumai in this shape?

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.540
But what on earth is the golden ratio?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.490
Ancient Greeks brought

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.440
our country

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:35.830
the so-called golden ratio via the Silk Road.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.550
It is said to be the most harmonious

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.490
and beautiful section ratio for separating everything.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:45.360
So I call it the Golden Ratio Shumai.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:47.420
I believe

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:49.380
there is no better shumai.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.890
You can't win this competition!

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.830
He wandered in the vast Mainland China

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:01.590
and defeated famous chefs

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:04.510
one by one. He's like a mark of victory.

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:06.160
This man

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.600
frustrated those famous chefs completely.

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:21.290
It's really delicious.

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.330
I didn't know that the ratio of the pork
to other ingredients

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:25.620
has such a great influence on the overall taste.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.290
What do you think, father?

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.360
Will Mao lose this battle?

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:33.100
I got it.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:35.920
Maybe it can be said to be

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:38.440
the best form of shumai.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.020
Dim Sum Master who's well-known in the mainland

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:43.270
is so great.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.240
That means Mao...

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:49.530
The ratio of the taste?

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.400
Don't listen to his boasts.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.130
A reason like that means nothing.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.760
Our Mao already has a countermeasure.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.010
Am I right, Mao?

00:06:58.530 --> 00:06:59.310
Mao.

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:04.930
What's wrong, Mao?

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:08.420
Silang, I lost this competition.

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:11.040
Why?

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:12.730
The result of the competition has not come out yet.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.170
I didn't expect that I used the same ingredients

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:16.140
as him.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:18.870
They're totally the same.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.980
But you said

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:21.870
you already have a countermeasure.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.110
It won't work!

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:24.220
Group

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:26.090
the four kinds of fillings respectively.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:27.280
That's my countermeasure.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.260
We have the same idea

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.340
and the same ingredients.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.430
But my shumai

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:33.860
is divided into four parts evenly.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:38.340
So I can't win the golden ratio!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.700
I won't win!

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:42.840
Chef Xie

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:44.570
is so powerful and amazing.

00:07:47.470 --> 00:07:48.510
Well, kid,

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.710
just be willing to be one of the

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:51.870
loser marks.

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.880
I'm... I'm too careless.

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.370
We have the same idea.

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:09.660
The opponent respected by me is great.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:14.040
But no matter how he approaches,

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.340
it's always impossible.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.740
There will not be better shumai.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.400
Mao,

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:20.150
you already did a good job.

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:21.610
I admit that.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:26.710
What should I do?

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.350
Should I just give up like that?

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:33.780
No. That's not the result I want.

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.510
There must be a great new idea.

00:08:37.190 --> 00:08:37.750
There must be.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.390
Mao.

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:47.700
Mao, we're running out of time.

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:49.200
We need to make shumai for fifty people.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.910
We have to make fifty shumai at least.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.560
It'll be too late if you keep putting it off.

00:08:53.610 --> 00:08:55.930
My shumai needs to win the Golden Ratio Shumai.

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:58.060
Can't I find a way out?

00:08:58.610 --> 00:08:59.240
Mao.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.370
What should I do?

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:06.880
What on earth should I do?

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.210
What on earth should I do?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.190
It's so wasteful.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:30.250
The egg whites are all mixed with the yolks.

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.210
We have no choice but to use them together.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:33.050
Together?

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:34.430
You're responsible for eating it.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:35.610
OK. I know.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:37.490
Together?

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:39.800
Right. I got an idea.

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.300
Mao.

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:44.630
What are you doing?

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.330
We're already running out of time.

00:09:46.470 --> 00:09:47.290
Yes.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.990
Slang, how much time do we have left?

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.560
We only have less than thirty minutes left.

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:53.120
Are you going to start over

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.360
and roll the dough again?

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.180
Yes. It's the key.

00:09:58.070 --> 00:09:59.570
Although I don't know what you're going to do,

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:01.480
I'll help you.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:02.760
Count me in!

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:04.660
Hurry up. Give me the flour.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:05.130
Give it to me as well.

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:07.660
That kid...

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:10.860
OK. That's it.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.400
Is he going to rotate it again?

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.760
Isn't it the same as before?

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:20.480
No, it's different.

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:23.670
He went out.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:24.420
Let's go out and have a look.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:43.370
He rotated it and turned it into such a big dough!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:14.630
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:19.200
What on earth does he want to do?

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:20.640
Time is almost up.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:23.440
We'll know the answer later.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:25.700
Well, don't bother him.

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:26.890
Let's wait inside.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.580
Well, go into the room. Go into the room.

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:30.520
I'll call you when he's done.

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:31.350
Stop bothering him.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.410
Silang. Meili.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:40.790
Bring me a bamboo steamer.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.120
Take the biggest one.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.960
The result of the competition still hasn't come out?

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.310
We've already been waiting so long.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:46.450
Who do you think will be the winner?

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:47.910
I also want to have a taste.

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:49.620
I'm so hungry.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:50.900
Anyway,

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:52.460
he just started to make shumai for fifty people now.

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:54.420
Even he's Mao, he can't finish it.

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:55.360
It's really a pity.

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:56.320
I'm afraid that this time...

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:01.520
Time is up.

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:05.550
Hand in your work, Mao.

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:09.420
OK. My work is coming.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:15.590
It's okay.

00:12:15.640 --> 00:12:17.130
Silang! Meili!

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:19.900
Come here.

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:22.570
Come here.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.570
What? This bamboo steamer...

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:29.490
Shumai for fifty people

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:30.880
is all in it?

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:32.460
How did they make it so fast?

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:34.370
I didn't know we have a bamboo steamer like that.

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:36.350
Thanks to

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.980
the odds and ends I usually do.

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:39.270
I'm clear about the position

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.360
of everything.

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:43.430
He pulled the big bamboo steamer
which hasn't been used

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:44.970
for years out.

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:47.200
But did he really make shumai for fifty people

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.590
in such a short time?

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:52.410
Impossible.

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.100
How could something like that happen?

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:55.570
How could he make shumai for fifty people again

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.830
in such a short time?

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:01.280
Mao, lift the lid.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:02.700
Yes.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.240
Hey, Silang. We're going to open it.

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.160
I'm ready!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.380
One. Two.

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:33.290
Amazing!

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:35.200
The bamboo steamer has been filled with it.

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:37.230
There is only one shumai.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:40.500
Specially made by Mao.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:44.040
Big Bang Shumai!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:46.780
We succeeded!

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:50.000
It's indeed enough for fifty people.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.450
After a painful struggle,
he just took out such a stopgap.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:55.650
How can such a big shumai

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.040
be cooked completely?

00:13:58.290 --> 00:13:59.450
It must taste terrible.

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.750
Chef Ruoh, please have a taste.

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:04.230
Kid, looks like you're not

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.530
that good.

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:07.670
I'll have a taste.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.660
He wrapped the filling with a loose wrapper.

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:22.170
He made it in the shape of a shumai.

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:38.510
The filling is not cooked. Am I right, Chef Ruoh?

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:42.270
No. The filling is completely cooked.

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:42.760
What?

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.970
Mao, you used the charcoal, right?

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:46.470
Yes.

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:48.280
Before I steamed it,

00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:49.600
I used the charcoal to grill it completely for a while.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:52.740
If you use the charcoal without flames,

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.770
the heat can reach the center directly.

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:57.740
The whole shumai can be heated evenly.

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:01.020
But there are more secrets

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.590
of this shumai besides it, right?

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:03.070
What?

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:08.010
He's going to eat the other side of the shumai.

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:00.370
I got it.

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:09.250
No wonder you call it Big Bang Shumai.

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:12.020
Chef Ruoh,

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.540
what kind of shumai is this?

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:16.050
Can anyone bring the Devil Cow Knife to me?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:16.670
Yes.

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:24.300
Thank you.

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:27.160
The reason why it's called the Devil Cow Knife

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.150
is that it can chop a cow's head in one swing.

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:49.890
Amazing!

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:52.230
What an extraordinary knife!

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:54.770
I saw it for the first time.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:55.740
Amazing!

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:58.440
He's not a common drunken old man.

00:16:58.840 --> 00:17:01.190
Chef Ruoh who is called

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:03.150
the Superman Chef of Guangzhou is so great.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:06.410
It's so exhausting.

00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:07.480
Chef Xie,

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:10.820
take a look at the cross section of this shumai.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.510
Its cross section is in the shape of the marble.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:18.540
According to your ability,

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:20.290
I believe you can figure it out.

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:21.050
Chef Xie.

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:26.640
Tenderloin. Leg. Shoulder. Head.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:28.080
This... This is...

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:30.580
Is this the secret of shumai?

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:37.420
Looks like you already figured it out.

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:39.480
After flapping the firm thigh

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.400
and making it cooked completely,

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:44.100
it will taste wild and delicious.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.160
Besides, flap the pork belly

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:47.490
to make it creamy.

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:49.360
Then the delicious taste of the oily fat

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:51.040
can be brought into full play.

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:54.870
The light taste.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:56.470
The fluffy softness.

00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:58.450
This is the pork belly.

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:03.580
The pig intestine is chewy but not greasy.

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.350
This is the pig tendon.

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.820
You're becoming more and more interesting.

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:18.780
Explain to me now.

00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:19.740
How did you make it?

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:21.670
Yes.

00:18:22.040 --> 00:18:23.130
When I saw Silang's eggs

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:24.120
fall to the ground,

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:25.250
I suddenly realized

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:27.830
segmentation is not the so-called perfect status.

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:34.210
So I made this big shumai instead.

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.560
I hoped I can wrap the delicious taste

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:37.690
of an entire pig in it.

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:42.250
I got it.

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:44.300
The reason why this shumai

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:45.270
is so rich in taste

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:46.550
is that you've wrapped an entire pig

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:49.070
in it.

00:18:49.360 --> 00:18:50.650
You're right.

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:52.920
In this shumai,

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.800
there is a shiny universe

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:56.560
with the biomass.

00:18:57.230 --> 00:18:58.510
Big Bang Shumai is really

00:18:58.800 --> 00:18:59.500
worthy of the name.

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:07.790
Use the silky wrapper to

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:08.850
to wrap the part you want to eat

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:11.060
of your ideal weight.

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:13.010
As a dim sum,

00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:14.650
it's so interesting.

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:16.650
No, this shumai

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:18.310
is not just a dim sum.

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:20.990
Even as a dish of the banquet,

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:23.700
it's definitely a luxurious dish which is very good.

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:28.110
I also want to have a taste.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:28.980
I also want to eat it.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:34.960
We definitely can't finish

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:37.210
Chef Xie's Golden Ratio Shumai

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.170
and Mao's Big Bang Shumai.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.140
Meili, open the gate.

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:43.380
Let others come in and eat together.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:44.130
OK.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:46.960
Big Bang Shumai.

00:19:47.510 --> 00:19:48.580
As a person who always

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:50.570
consider shumai as a dim sum,

00:19:50.970 --> 00:19:51.880
I'm afraid that

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:53.150
I can't think of this idea.

00:19:56.370 --> 00:19:58.170
Kid, I have to admire you.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:19:59.100
You're so amazing.

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:01.170
You won this competition.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:05.200
Great! You won!

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.690
Am I right, Chef Ruoh?

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:13.180
The Big Bang Shumai is so big.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:14.050
This is called

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:15.260
the Golden Shumai, I think.

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.080
Stop crowding each other.

00:20:16.140 --> 00:20:17.680
It's too dangerous.

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:20.520
Are you okay?

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:23.100
Your butt is like a throw pillow, right?

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:24.280
Silang!

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:25.970
I have a question, kid.

00:20:26.290 --> 00:20:27.480
What's the matter with you?

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.070
It was you who asked me to eat

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:31.490
the terrible Fried Assorted Vegetables

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.360
without oil, right?

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:34.870
Actually...

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.180
Thank you.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:39.530
Because of you,

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:41.450
I got a chance to know him.

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.110
There's a lot of sense in what you said.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:47.060
You're above yourself now.

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:48.890
Do you know what will happen to the gofer

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:49.810
who cooks a dish without permission

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:51.360
based on the rules of

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.880
Yang Spring Restaurant?

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:56.410
Will I...

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:59.110
Well, it's a great sin.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.140
Father, are you serious?

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.240
Zhou Yu.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:04.440
I'll punish you

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:08.290
by pounding Chef Ruoh's back.

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:09.070
Pound his back?

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:12.050
Great. Great.

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:15.200
I haven't used the Devil Cow Knife for a long time,

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:17.190
so my shoulder is painful.

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:18.490
Shoot.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:21.260
Chef Xie,

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:23.760
this is the first time

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:25.880
I took part in such an interesting cooking competition.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.180
I believe one day

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:29.760
we'll meet again in somewhere of the mainland.

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:31.980
Let's try an interesting competition

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:33.520
again in the future.

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:34.150
No problem.

00:21:35.040 --> 00:21:37.170
The competition is so exciting.

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:38.660
I don't know how great

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:41.340
Mao will be in the future.

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:46.010
Looks like I should find a way

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:48.380
to live well until that time.

00:23:14.976 --> 00:23:16.979
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.645 --> 00:23:22.067
Suddenly, Zhou Yu and Meili receive
an invitation to a dinner party,

00:23:22.192 --> 00:23:26.864
and it has a secret sign that all chefs must obey.

00:23:27.196 --> 00:23:28.990
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.115 --> 00:23:30.783
A Mysterious Invitation:

00:23:30.826 --> 00:23:32.827
The Masked Chef's Trap!

00:23:32.952 --> 00:23:34.495
It will definitely be interesting!
